  "description": "LEVELS OF ASSISTANCE Five power levels to best manage the support, guaranteeing exceptional performance to tackle any type of route. MOTOR The REAR HUB rear hub motor develops a power of 250W and a torque of 45 Nm at a weight of just over 3 kg. Compact and versatile, it does not require any special ordinary maintenance. BATTERY The ultra slim 360 Wh intube battery is inserted and perfectly integrated into the downtube. Thanks to its small size it is completely invisible, and the weight and handling of the frame benefit from it. Autonomy up to 60 km in excellent path/cyclist conditions.\n\nBE GREEN TECHNOLOGIES The 28\" HPG aluminum frame with a fully integrated battery is paired with a hub motor for a particularly smooth and easy ride. The ultra-slim battery is fully integrated into the downtube and easily recharged via the dedicated charging jack. The Shimano 8-speed gearbox and hydraulic brake contribute to riding comfort. Standard equipment also includes mudguards, a luggage rack, preparation for a front basket, and a lighting system, for the perfect urban setup. IDEAL FOR ACTIVE is designed for daily commutes on asphalt and light dirt roads, for navigating traffic, getting to work or running errands in the city centre. PERFECT FOR YOU IF For those looking for a versatile and comfortable vehicle, perfect for easily getting around the city. Thanks to its lightweight design and compact structure, it's perfect for both urban and light off-road use.",
